{"id":"vod_md_2948","vodId":"2948","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"潘朵拉之心","name_cn":"潘朵拉之心","date":"2009-01-01","year":"2009","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"25集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20230821-1/d3d7fc5d189487e1dd4f7763e9b06b8f.jpg"},"summary":"世界被四大公爵家族所掌控着，奥兹（皆川纯子 配音）是萨流士家的下一任当家，然而，在十五岁成人仪式上，他却因为“存在”这种莫名其妙的理由被定罪，之后被投入了永远不得超生的阿鬼茨监狱之中。在监狱里，奥兹遇见了被称为“染血黑兔”的艾莉丝（小野大辅 配音），在艾莉丝的帮助之下，奥兹成功的逃出了监狱，并意外的回到了十年之前。重新获得自由之后，奥兹决定查明整个事件的真相，揪出想要抹杀他存在的幕后真凶。在此过程中，艾莉丝在奥兹的帮助之下亦试图寻回他失落的记忆。两人来到了传说中的禁忌之地，究竟有怎样的秘密隐藏在那里呢？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"动作,动画,奇幻"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-08-21 08:10:15","classic":true,"classicRank":47,"franchise":"潘朵拉之心","playable":true,"episodeCount":25,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230820/ubI7Tz85/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230820/mXCKgrNA/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230820/uufai6zP/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230820/OclVg6l2/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230820/4CFgVv48/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230820/9VaGMLgy/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230820/4mfrgyqC/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230820/p30JxVr4/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230820/Jq4Im3v4/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230820/G4kw3MC7/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230820/OqS3nSjV/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230820/bX7Nb8co/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230820/9QB0Ibj3/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230820/7MfWzTfA/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230820/tv0MLkcn/index.m3u8"},